m {zone:1457}: cast {spell:18960} and take {npc:11800}'s flight from the middle of {area:2361} (she flies druids to {area:702}, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Aquatic Form yet? Take A Lesson to Learn from him too: it also goes to {npc:11802}, and its Trial of the Lake (the Aquatic Form guide) is in the same {area:493}."] = "Mathrengyl Bearwalker stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Skyborne far from Darnassus: cast Teleport: Moonglade and take Silva Fil'naveth's flight from the middle of Nighthaven (she flies druids to Rut'theran Village, no flight path needed), then the portal up. No Aquatic Form yet? Take A Lesson to Learn from him too: it also goes to Dendrite, and its Trial of the Lake (the Aquatic Form guide) is in the same Moonglade." },
