					note = "Take the befouled staff to {area:2279}, the dungeon at the north end of {zone:1423}, through the main gate. On {object:175433} find the patch of {object:181206} with a small white flame on it, stand on it and use the staff: {npc:16387}, Hand of Sargeras (level 63 boss) steps out. Bring a strong group: his {spell:17466} hurts everyone and cannot be dispelled (shadow resistance helps), his {spell:28342} curse must be removed at once, and a warrior's Disarm makes him drop his sword, which a melee player can pick up and use against him. He stays up to two and a half hours, so you can regroup.",
