					title = "{item:20028}",
					note = "The blood elves hold the {area:1220} on the hills of north-eastern {zone:1447}. Blood Elf Surveyors (51-52, {spell:8349} up close) and Reclaimers (52-53, {spell:133}, and they heal and {spell:139} each other) each drop the dust about one time in four; they spot you from far off, so pull at the edges. They come back after 5 1/2 minutes.",
