				{
					title = "Morphaz in the {area:1417}",
					note = "Morphaz is a level 52 elite green dragon inside the {area:1417}, a five-player dungeon: bring a group of five (a level 60 group clears it with ease). Horde: fly to {area:75}; Alliance: fly to {area:1438} in the {zone:1419} and ride north. The temple stands in the middle of the {area:74}: climb the steps on its south side, swim down through the flooded hall and take the stairs to the portal. Inside, Morphaz only appears late: kill the six troll minibosses on the upper balconies, then {npc:5710} below them; that wakes the drakes Weaver and Dreamscythe in the Pit of Sacrifice, and killing both brings Morphaz and Hazzas. The pair patrols together and cannot be split: pull them into a hallway and have the tank face them away from the group (breath and a knockback). Loot him in a party, not a raid group: the blood always drops.",
