					},
				},
				{
					title = "{quest:96782}",
					note = "Back to {npc:13085}; the report sends you after the Perenolde heirlooms. Two towers stand among the {area:281}, in the middle of the {zone:1416}, held by ogres: the shield lies in the northern tower, the sword in the southern one, which elite ogres ring and watch from far off. Stay stealthed; nothing guards the heirlooms inside.",
