				{
					title = "Cultists until the top of Friendly, texts saved",
					note = "Neutral to Honored is 9,000 reputation (7,000 for druids). Every {npc:11880}, Geolord, Stonecaller, Master and Overlord gives 1 reputation until 5,999 of 6,000 Friendly, one point short of Honored; there they stop. Save every {item:20404} and leave the quests of the next steps for later: each kill below that point is a free point on top of its text, and the texts and quests pay the same at any standing. A text drops about every third kill, so 30 kills make 30 reputation and 10 texts (100 reputation later). Four camps: south-west of the Hold (39,44), the far west (26,34), the far south-west (19,84) and the north-east below {area:2742} (66,18: Overlords, and Flamereavers that count until the top of Honored). The {npc:15308} (87% text) walks between 18,31 and 23,69. Texts sell on the auction house if you would rather buy. At 5,999 Friendly the last point into Honored comes from a Flamereaver, Twilight Keeper or Marauder, or from your first 10 texts at {npc:15306}.",
					goals = {
						{ t = "note", text = "Kills alone to the top of Friendly is 8,999 kills (6,999 for druids), but the texts they drop (about 3,000) are worth 30,000 more: most of the way to Exalted." },
						{ t = "note", text = "Friendly (3,000) opens Kania's {item:20732} (10g), Mishta's {item:22251} (2g) and {item:22758} (5g), and Forever's new Friendly gloves patterns (7g 50s)." },
