					title = "{zone:1451} quests at {area:3425}",
					note = "Now cash in the one-time quests: about 1,700 reputation alone, 2,400 with the group quests. They are level 55 to 60, so they pay in full at 60. {quest:8280} needs {quest:8275} first. {npc:15196} is an elite scorpid with two guards (group of 2 or 3). {npc:15174}'s {quest:8307} is for Cooks: its recipe makes the {item:20452} he wants. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.",
