			written = { ["Exalted opens the camp's tabard (200 Favor) at {npc:256389} or {npc:256384}, and the {item:262766} (6,000 Favor; the mount needs level 60 and Journeyman mount training) at {npc:256736} in {area:1002} or Okamache at the {area:380} camp. The {npc:10636} guide under Collectibles leads you there."] = "Exalted opens the camp's tabard (200 Favor) at Tamelyn Aldridge or Gishah, and the Reins of the Pack Kodo (6,000 Favor; the mount needs level 60 and Journeyman mount training) at Huey Sunnydale in Three Corners or Okamache at the Crossroads camp. The Pack Kodo guide under Collectibles leads you there.", ["Friendly opens the first gated recipes at the camp's profession vendors ({skill:197} 25, {skill:165} 17, {skill:333} 13, {skill:164} 10, {skill:202} 10, {skill:171} 5, {skill:185} 2) and the Uncertified Scribe: {npc:256742} at {area:1002}, {npc:256672} at the south end of the {area:380} camp. The scribe's {item:262902} (15 Merchant's Favor) turns an empty {item:248549} into a {item:262917}; hand it to {npc:256390} or {npc:256386} for 50 reputation ({quest:93862}). Any crate works, so buy the cheapest one the Auction House has. Honored is 6000 more: 80 Journeyman writs, 48 Expert, 30 Artisan, or 120 crate returns (1,800 Favor and 120 crates). Mix both: every writ you can fill, returns with spare Favor. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "Friendly opens the first gated recipes at the camp's profession vendors (Tailoring 25, Leatherworking 17, Enchanting 13, Blacksmithing 10, Engineering 10, Alchemy 5, Cooking 2) and the Uncertified Scribe: Dianne Softstep at Three Corners, Kurvelk Shadowhoof at the south end of the Crossroads camp. The scribe's Forged Delivery Receipt (15 Merchant's Favor) turns an empty Waylaid Crate into a Notarized Shipping Container; hand it to Marcy Baker or Dokimi for 50 reputation (Crate Return). Any crate works, so buy the cheapest one the Auction House has. Honored is 6000 more: 80 Journeyman writs, 48 Expert, 30 Artisan, or 120 crate returns (1,800 Favor and 120 crates). Mix both: every writ you can fill, returns with spare Favor. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.", ["The {faction:2587} camp stands just outside the west gate of the {area:380}. The label pays 2000 reputation once (and, by beta reports, 50 Merchant's Favor): two thirds of the way to Friendly. Filled crates go to {npc:256386} too, but they pay only Merchant's Favor and silver, never reputation."] = "The Durotar Supply and Logistics camp stands just outside the west gate of the Crossroads. The label pays 2000 reputation once (and, by beta reports, 50 Merchant's Favor): two thirds of the way to Friendly. Filled crates go to Dokimi too, but they pay only Merchant's Favor and silver, never reputation." },
