				{
					title = "Gather your writs again",
					note = "Craftsman's Writs are the camp's reputation: 75 for a Journeyman writ, 125 for an Expert, 200 for an Artisan. Each asks for one crafted item, named in its quest (not always the writ's title: a {spell:3176} writ wants a {item:3388}). Make it or buy it on the Auction House; you need not know the profession. Each writ can be done once a day, and any number of different ones. Take the quest only of writs whose item you have or will buy on the way (right-click the writ), keep the writ in your bags, then tick this: the next steps lead to each customer you hold a writ for.",
