				{
					title = "Friendly to Honored",
					note = "Friendly opens the first gated recipes at the camp's profession vendors ({skill:197} 25, {skill:165} 17, {skill:333} 13, {skill:164} 10, {skill:202} 10, {skill:171} 5, {skill:185} 2) and the Uncertified Scribe: {npc:256742} at {area:1002}, {npc:256672} at the south end of the {area:380} camp. The scribe's {item:262902} (15 Merchant's Favor) turns an empty {item:248549} into a {item:262917}; hand it to {npc:256390} or {npc:256386} for 50 reputation ({quest:93862}). Any crate works, so buy the cheapest one the Auction House has. Honored is 6000 more: 80 Journeyman writs, 48 Expert, 30 Artisan, or 120 crate returns (1,800 Favor and 120 crates). Mix both: every writ you can fill, returns with spare Favor. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.",
