				{
					title = "{npc:10267}",
					note = "{npc:10267}, a goblin at {area:251} in the north of the {zone:1428}, has a chain that pays every town 150 and {faction:577} 150 more. Use her {item:12284} on a broodling, kill it while the device holds it, and pick up the {quest:4726} it leaves. The device takes only Black and Scalding Broodlings, not the Flamescale Broodlings of the west: Scalding Broodlings (level 53-54) roam just west and east of {area:251}, Black Broodlings (51-52) the north-east corner of the zone, the thickest group. They are few and spread out: the path passes both and ends among the Black Broodlings.",
